### 03. Fit To Work (FTW) API Requests
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@authToken = {{login.response.body.data.token}}

# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "angel@unggul.co.id",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Get Today FTW Logs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ftw/today
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Get FTW History
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ftw/history
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Submit Sleep Log
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ftw/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "shift": "siang",
  "sleepMin": 440
}
